title Spike 22b: models
about Every T1 type built from a few primitives, with trim and accent colours (metal, tracks, lights) over the side's colour. Front row: raider, tank, artillery, siege, engineer, sapper, scout, metal and energy trucks; back row: extractor, generator, factory, transporter, turret, vaults. Then the units drive off.

